window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>They say the fae used to take the most beautiful maidens and make them their brides. </b> </p> <p>They lied. </p> <p>What they do with them is much worse<b>. </b> </p> <p>After the seven lords of Sidhe are massacred in one day, the thrones of the fae realm pass down to their heirs. </p> <p>The Iron Circle remains leaderless, as its true lord lives in another world. </p> <p>The nobles of the realm will find the heir, and they will destroy him.</p> <p>Or her. </p> <p>West, in the Silver Circle, a new lord has taken the throne. </p> <p>A warrior who never hesitates to crush ants for the good of the world. </p> <p>A man whose rule will change the fate of their realms. </p> <p>Melpomene has never known where she came from, and after centuries, she’s stopped caring. </p> <p>Until the fae take her, dragging her to a land where bloodlines and power is everything.</p> <p>To survive, she needs to embrace the monster buried inside. </p> <p>Lords of Sidhe is a fantasy romance trilogy.</p> <p>The series is unsuitable for sensitive listeners. </p>"; 
